  "description": "The generic device plugin advertising the GPU render nodes Jellyfin transcodes with. The project publishes no dashboard; its metrics are generic_device_plugin_devices and generic_device_plugin_allocations_total (deviceplugin/generic.go) and generic_device_plugin_restarts_total (deviceplugin/plugin.go, registered with the generic_ prefix), each labelled with the resource name (main.go), plus the default Go and process collectors, all at 0.2.0.",
